menu "Vehicle Health OS gateway"

config VHOS_STATUS_SOFTAP_AUTOSTART
    bool "Automatically start the local status SoftAP at boot"
    default n
    help
        Development-bench option only. When enabled, the authenticated read-only
        status SoftAP starts for 15 minutes after every boot. Keep this disabled
        for ordinary vehicle and home operation. The production activation path
        will be an explicit encrypted BLE commissioning command.

endmenu
